      "sourceText": "1.  参数中声明四个轮子的 joint 名。\n2.  `command_interface_configuration()` 返回四个 `<joint>/velocity`。\n3.  `state_interface_configuration()` 返回需要读取的 `<joint>/position` 或 `<joint>/velocity`。\n4.  `on_configure()` 创建 `cmd_vel` 订阅者。\n5.  订阅者把最新速度命令写入实时 buffer。\n6.  `update()` 读取最新速度命令。\n7.  根据运动学模型计算各轮速度。\n8.  把结果写入 `command_interfaces_`。",
      "translatedText": "1.  Declare the joint names of the four wheels in the parameters\\.\n2.  `command_interface_configuration()` Returns four `<joint>/velocity`\\.\n3.  `state_interface_configuration()` Returns the `<joint>/position` or `<joint>/velocity` that need to be read\\.\n4.  `on_configure()` Create a `cmd_vel` subscriber\\.\n5.  The subscriber writes the latest velocity command into the real\\-time buffer\\.\n6.  `update()` Read the latest velocity command\\.\n7.  Calculate each wheel's speed according to the kinematic model\\.\n8.  Write the results into `command_interfaces_`\\.",
