      "sourceText": "输入里程计与扫描没有时间配对或插值，也没有等待有效里程计的保护；近场点云同样没有同步与新鲜度检查。节点直接使用输入坐标，未校验参考系，最后却固定写 `odom`。这些前提对坡面高度和距离分区都有影响。",
      "translatedText": "The input odometry and scan are not time\\-paired or interpolated, and there is no protection for waiting for valid odometry; the near\\-field point cloud likewise lacks synchronization and freshness checks\\. The node directly uses the input coordinates without validating the reference frame, yet at the end it fixedly writes `odom`\\. These premises affect both the slope height and the distance partitioning\\.",
